            {
              "file": "sdk/ml/azure-ai-ml/IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md",
              "patch": "Index: sdk/ml/azure-ai-ml/IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md\n===================================================================\n--- sdk/ml/azure-ai-ml/IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md\t\n+++ sdk/ml/azure-ai-ml/IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md\t\n@@ -0,0 +1,194 @@\n+# Implementation Summary: camelCase to snake_case Task Conversion\n+\n+## Overview\n+This implementation enables fine-tuning job objects to accept task arguments in camelCase form (e.g., `\"chatCompletion\"`, `\"textCompletion\"`) and correctly translate them to the SDK's internal snake_case representation (e.g., `\"chat_completion\"`, `\"text_completion\"`).\n+\n+## Changes Made\n+\n+### 1. FineTuningConstants (`azure/ai/ml/constants/_job/finetuning.py`)\n+Added `SUPPORTED_TASKS` dictionary that maps both camelCase and PascalCase task names to snake_case:\n+\n+```python\n+SUPPORTED_TASKS = {\n+    \"chatCompletion\": \"chat_completion\",\n+    \"ChatCompletion\": \"chat_completion\",  # PascalCase from REST API\n+    \"textCompletion\": \"text_completion\",\n+    \"TextCompletion\": \"text_completion\",\n+    # ... all 11 supported task types in both formats\n+}\n+```\n+\n+**Supported Task Types:**\n+- chatCompletion / ChatCompletion → chat_completion\n+- textCompletion / TextCompletion → text_completion\n+- textClassification / TextClassification → text_classification\n+- questionAnswering / QuestionAnswering → question_answering\n+- textSummarization / TextSummarization → text_summarization\n+- tokenClassification / TokenClassification → token_classification\n+- textTranslation / TextTranslation → text_translation\n+- imageClassification / ImageClassification → image_classification\n+- imageInstanceSegmentation / ImageInstanceSegmentation → image_instance_segmentation\n+- imageObjectDetection / ImageObjectDetection → image_object_detection\n+- videoMultiObjectTracking / VideoMultiObjectTracking → video_multi_object_tracking\n+\n+### 2. FineTuningVertical (`azure/ai/ml/entities/_job/finetuning/finetuning_vertical.py`)\n+\n+#### Added Import\n+```python\n+from azure.ai.ml.constants._job.finetuning import FineTuningConstants\n+```\n+\n+#### Modified `__init__` Method\n+Changed from direct assignment to validated conversion:\n+```python\n+# Before:\n+self._task = task\n+\n+# After:\n+self._task = self._validate_and_convert_task(task)\n+```\n+\n+#### Added `_validate_and_convert_task` Static Method\n+```python\n+@staticmethod\n+def _validate_and_convert_task(task: str) -> str:\n+    if task not in FineTuningConstants.SUPPORTED_TASKS:\n+        msg = (\n+            f\"Unsupported task type: {task}. \"\n+            f\"Supported task types are: {', '.join(FineTuningConstants.SUPPORTED_TASKS.keys())}\"\n+        )\n+        raise ValidationException(\n+            message=msg,\n+            no_personal_data_message=msg,\n+            target=ErrorTarget.FINETUNING,\n+            error_category=ErrorCategory.USER_ERROR,\n+        )\n+    return FineTuningConstants.SUPPORTED_TASKS[task]\n+```\n+\n+This method:\n+- Validates the task against supported values\n+- Raises `ValidationException` for unsupported tasks\n+- Returns the snake_case representation\n+\n+#### Modified `task` Property Setter\n+Updated to use validation:\n+```python\n+@task.setter\n+def task(self, task: str) -> None:\n+    self._task = self._validate_and_convert_task(task)\n+```\n+\n+## Behavior\n+\n+### Object Construction\n+When a user creates an `AzureOpenAIFineTuningJob` or `CustomModelFineTuningJob`:\n+\n+```python\n+job = AzureOpenAIFineTuningJob(\n+    task=\"chatCompletion\",  # User provides camelCase\n+    model=...,\n+    training_data=...,\n+)\n+```\n+\n+The task is:\n+1. Validated against `SUPPORTED_TASKS`\n+2. Converted to snake_case\n+3. Stored internally as `\"chat_completion\"`\n+\n+### REST Object Generation\n+When calling `_to_rest_object()`:\n+\n+```python\n+rest_obj = job._to_rest_object()\n+# rest_obj.properties.fine_tuning_details.task_type == \"chat_completion\"\n+```\n+\n+The REST object receives the snake_case value because `self._task` is already converted.\n+\n+### REST to SDK Conversion\n+When loading from REST object via `_from_rest_object()`:\n+\n+```python\n+job = AzureOpenAIFineTuningJob._from_rest_object(rest_obj)\n+# rest_obj.properties.fine_tuning_details.task_type might be \"ChatCompletion\" (PascalCase)\n+# job.task will be \"chat_completion\" (snake_case)\n+```\n+\n+The PascalCase value from REST is converted to snake_case.\n+\n+### Task Property Access\n+```python\n+job.task  # Returns \"chat_completion\" (snake_case)\n+```\n+\n+### Task Property Assignment\n+```python\n+job.task = \"textClassification\"  # Converted to \"text_classification\"\n+```\n+\n+### Validation Error\n+```python\n+job = AzureOpenAIFineTuningJob(\n+    task=\"invalidTask\",  # Raises ValidationException\n+    ...\n+)\n+```\n+\n+Error message:\n+```\n+Unsupported task type: invalidTask. Supported task types are: chatCompletion, ChatCompletion, textCompletion, ...\n+```\n+\n+## Affected Classes\n+\n+### Direct Changes\n+- `FineTuningVertical` - Base class with validation logic\n+\n+### Inherited Behavior (No Changes Required)\n+- `AzureOpenAIFineTuningJob` - Inherits validation from `FineTuningVertical`\n+- `CustomModelFineTuningJob` - Inherits validation from `FineTuningVertical`\n+\n+Both classes automatically benefit from the validation because:\n+1. They call `super().__init__(task=task, ...)` which invokes `FineTuningVertical.__init__`\n+2. They use `self._task` in their `_to_rest_object()` methods\n+3. They pass `finetuning_details.task_type` to constructors in `_from_rest_object()`\n+\n+## Test Coverage\n+\n+New test file: `tests/finetuning_job/unittests/test_task_conversion.py`\n+\n+Tests include:\n+- camelCase to snake_case conversion for all task types\n+- PascalCase to snake_case conversion for all task types\n+- Invalid task validation\n+- Task setter conversion\n+- Round-trip conversion (SDK → REST → SDK)\n+\n+## Backward Compatibility\n+\n+This is a **breaking change** for code that:\n+1. Directly accesses `job._task` and expects the original input format\n+2. Expects `job.task` to return the exact input format\n+3. Relies on unsupported task types\n+\n+However, this change improves consistency by:\n+- Standardizing internal representation to snake_case\n+- Aligning with Python naming conventions\n+- Providing clear validation errors for invalid tasks\n+- Supporting both user-friendly camelCase and REST PascalCase formats\n+\n+## Files Modified\n+\n+1. `/workspace/sdk/ml/azure-ai-ml/azure/ai/ml/constants/_job/finetuning.py`\n+   - Added `SUPPORTED_TASKS` dictionary\n+\n+2. `/workspace/sdk/ml/azure-ai-ml/azure/ai/ml/entities/_job/finetuning/finetuning_vertical.py`\n+   - Added import for `FineTuningConstants`\n+   - Modified `__init__` to call validation\n+   - Added `_validate_and_convert_task` static method\n+   - Modified `task` setter to call validation\n+\n+3. `/workspace/sdk/ml/azure-ai-ml/tests/finetuning_job/unittests/test_task_conversion.py`\n+   - New test file with comprehensive test coverage\n",
              "additions": 194,
              "deletions": 0,
              "status": "added"
            },
