        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n\nGood, the `_from_rest_object` passes `finetuning_details.task_type` which will be in PascalCase (e.g., \"ChatCompletion\"), and our mapping now supports that format, so it will correctly convert to snake_case.\n\nLet's verify the complete flow by reviewing the key parts of our implementation:\n\n",
          "time": {
            "start": 1782114704767,
            "end": 1782114704782
          },
          "id": "prt_eee505d7f0017d05csS0i2E3Nw",
